#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1031054351" tvg-name="Shot across a range of dramatic landscapes‚ six short but intimate conversations take place between figures from Greek mythology. These demi-gods‚ heroes and other Pagan characters question their existence and seek to understand one another. A collection of encounters based on Pavese’s 1947 text Dialoghi con Leucò that thrive off themes such as destiny‚ life‚ memory‚ time‚ death and sacrifice.<br/>From 01.04.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Dialogues after the End (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.04.2024)
