#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="538020711" tvg-name="In Estaque-Riaux‚ Marseille's gritty northern suburb‚ Gilbert and his crew grapple with a bleak future as factories shutter. Juggling odd jobs and bar hangouts‚ they confront a reality starkly different from their parents'. Amidst the struggle‚ Banana's resilience‚ Boule's vulnerability‚ and Mario's dilemmas embody the poignant clash between tradition and the harsh truths of modern life.<br/>From 01.03.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Last Summer (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.03.2024)
