#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="1606428188" tvg-name="Sister Smile released her hit single Dominique in 1962‚ before an appearance on the Ed Sullivan Show catapulted “The Singing Nun” to the top of the US charts. But Sister Smile‚ real name Jeanne Deckers‚ became a plaything of the almighty music industry‚ and the Catholic Church. A closeted gay woman‚ her life was tragically cut short by suicide. <br/>From 24.10.2023 13:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Singing Nun - Who Killed the Voice of God? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (24.10.2023)
