#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="1910857136" tvg-name="Is it possible to have an addiction to the internet when most daily tasks require the Internet? That's especially true for couples who've only ever met online and depend on technology to keep the relationship going. For them‚ spending more than 7 hours a day on their phone is normal. But the DSM would describe them as addicts.<br/>From 30.01.2022 11:59" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",#AMINORMAL (2/8) - Managing a Long Distance Relationship (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (30.01.2022)
