#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="1639280145" tvg-name="For the past fourteen years‚ Brice has taken his herd of cows to graze in vast pastures in the mountains‚ five months out of the year. He loves to run to the point of exhaustion in the Pyrenees‚ across the steep slopes‚ ridges and rocks at 3000 metres above sea level. It's a spartan‚ lonely existence‚ but for Brice‚ it is the definition of happiness.<br/>From 10.05.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Escape to a Hut in the Pyrenees - 360° GEO (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (10.05.2024)
