#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="1987517006" tvg-name="Legend has it that shortly before dawn‚ the forest was bewitched and full of secrets. This is the time when one of its most skittish residents can be seen: the deer. Old legends say that stags have demonic powers. The black woodpecker used to be suspected of witchcraft because of the strange noises it makes‚ while badgers were suspect for being nocturnal.<br/>From 24.05.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Myths and Legends of Wild Animals - The Mysteries of the Forest (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (24.05.2024)
