#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="1589521529" tvg-name="Toads‚ bats and snakes‚ often found near its banks were considered too creepy to be entirely natural. But take a close-up look at the real creatures behind the stories‚ and you'll discover that truth is stranger than fiction. Especially when it comes to the reproductive habits of toads. <br/>From 24.05.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Myths and Legends of Wild Animals - The Creepy Residents of Rivers and Lakes (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (24.05.2024)
