#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="1265813039" tvg-name="In the Middle Ages‚ owls were nailed to doors‚ cats persecuted almost to extinction‚ and magpies considered unscrupulous thieves. But the animals are not only harmless‚ they also bring numerous advantages to the humans they live near. Cats keep mice populations in check at home‚ while in the fields the silent owl stops rodents from destroying the harvest. This documentary series appreciates the be.....<br/>From 17.05.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Myths and Legends of Wild Animals - Barn Owls‚ Cats and Magpies (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (17.05.2024)
