#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="1053280938" tvg-name="The red fox‚ winter or summer‚ is always on the hunt for food. Despite the fact it keeps rodent populations in check‚ it's an animal with an extremely bad reputation‚ resented for going after chickens and thought of as a pest. <br/>From 17.05.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Myths and Legends of Wild Animals - The Secret Life of the Prairie (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (17.05.2024)
