#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="1931889170" tvg-name="From Chur‚ Switzerland’s oldest city‚ to Tirano in Northern Italy‚ the Bernina Express winds its way through deep valleys and wild gorges‚ crossing some 196 bridges and going through 55 tunnels in its journey through the Graubünden Alps. A journey to discover one of the most spectacular railway lines in the world and an audacious feat of engineering.<br/>From 07.05.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Bernina Express - A Train through the Alps (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (07.05.2024)
