#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="1200466313" tvg-name="This three-part documentary tells the little-known story of the alliances between criminal organisations and financial institutions from the 1920s to the present day. Episode 2: the 1980s banking deregulation coincided with the rise of the heroin and cocaine trade in the USA. The result was a bonanza for drug traffickers and banks.<br/>From 25.01.2024 16:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Mafia and Banks (2/3) - Follow the Money (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (25.01.2024)
