#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="1846179743" tvg-name="In 1938‚ the Nazis first considered establishing so-called 'Jewish residential districts'. One year later‚ the first ghettos were established in Nazi-occupied Poland. This documentary tells the gruesome story of the Jewish ghettos based on records written by their inhabitants. They bear witness to the human tragedy of the holocaust‚ but also to an indomitable will to live.<br/>From 23.01.2024 14:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Ghettos of the Holocaust (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (23.01.2024)
