#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="332775609" tvg-name="The fact that we have a breathable atmosphere on Earth is largely down to algae. Could these aquatic plants be the secret of solving climate change and saving ourselves and the planet?<br/>From 17.10.2023 14:35" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Answer to Almost Everything - Could Algae Save the Planet? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (17.10.2023)
