#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="2078525657" tvg-name="We spend large stretches of our waking hours imagining things or just daydreaming. Why are we so often away in the clouds? What are our imaginations for?<br/>From 27.02.2024 11:24" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - What Are Our Imaginations For? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (27.02.2024)
