#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="837850167" tvg-name="The beauty of the peacock troubled Darwin for a long time. It didn't quite fit into his theory of evolution and the idea of 'survival of the fittest.' Darwin came to the conviction that animals must also possess a sense of beauty. Especially the females‚ who select the 'beautiful' males. Modern-day ornithologist Richard O. Prum is convinced that 'the complexity of aesthetic and sexual pleasure' in.....<br/>From 18.10.2023 12:17" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Do Animals Appreciate Beauty? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (18.10.2023)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/109000/109800/109818-003-A_SQ_0_VE%5BANG%5D-STE%5BANG%5D_08265611_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-101133533575975_2As4G16tzf2.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1348589842" tvg-name="It seemed that human intelligence could progress indefinitely. The evolution of medicine‚ science and technology looked to be limitless. Research proved each generation of human was more intelligent than the last. Until suddenly they weren't. Humanity is getting stupider.<br/>From 28.09.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Are We Getting Stupider? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (28.09.2023)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/104000/104800/104841-001-A_SQ_0_VOEU-STE%5BANG%5D_08193997_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-101102903538449_29Tny10fhQJ.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="23256038" tvg-name="Humans lie‚ deceive‚ and wage merciless wars. Sometimes it seems as if evil is typically human. On the other hand‚ humans can also be good‚ love‚ and even make peace with enemies. Which side within us is stronger? The good or the evil?<br/>From 28.08.2023 13:07" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Humanity's True Nature (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (28.08.2023)
