#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="465877194" tvg-name="We cannot escape our fate and we cannot escape ourselves. But we also have our limits: confused thinking‚ misleading intuitions‚ unrealiable memories... What consequences do these potential errors have on our relationship to the world and to ourselves? Just how far can we trust ourselves?<br/>From 02.09.2022 14:37" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Can We Trust Ourselves? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (02.09.2022)
