#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1586213680" tvg-name="Whether it's filling a job‚ granting credit or imposing a prison sentence‚ how can you be sure of making rational decisions? Wouldn't it be wiser to rely on artificial intelligence‚ a technology already deployed in many cases‚ with surprising results?<br/>From 03.03.2023 10:40" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Are Computers Biased? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (03.03.2023)
