#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="219364462" tvg-name="To tackle climate change‚ one option is to artificially cool the Earth or capture CO2. The field of geoengineering is full of seemingly outlandish ways of manipulating the planet's climate.<br/>From 03.03.2023 10:36" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Geoengineering: Earth's Last Resort (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (03.03.2023)
