#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1691792788" tvg-name="While serial killers fascinate Hollywood‚ most psychopaths are not murderers. They're smart enough to blend into the crowd. So how do you recognise them? And are they dangerous?<br/>From 16.10.2023 08:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - The Psychopaths Among Us (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (16.10.2023)
