#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1204156585" tvg-name="Every owner knows that their dog loves them. Humans have a very special bond with dogs‚ and this relationship has been around for thousands of years. But what if man’s best friend wasn’t really a friend? Could our four-legged friends be manipulating us to get what they want?<br/>From 11.01.2024 11:11" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Do Dogs Really Love Us? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (11.01.2024)
