#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1830281953" tvg-name="Parasites get a bad rap: they can make us sick or even kill us. For centuries‚ we have been trying to protect ourselves against them‚ in particular through hygiene measures. Yet half of the living beings on Earth are parasites. If they are really everywhere‚ maybe they are not fundamentally useless?<br/>From 26.02.2022 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - The Purpose of Parasites (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (26.02.2022)
